{"id": "1944", "type": "page", "slug": "contact-us", "path": "contact-us", "title": "Contact Us", "date": "2025-04-15 11:00:52", "modified": "2026-06-05 16:19:42", "excerpt": "", "content": "<h1>Contact Us</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>Hippocrates Wellness </strong>TripAdvisor Rating</h6>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"47\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/tripadvisor.png\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>How can we best help you today?</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"467\" height=\"422\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/talk-now.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Talk to us now</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Ready to talk to us now? Our wellness consultants are on hand from 9am to 5pm EST and will help you with any enquires relating to our programs and passports, and are available for any bookings, reservations, or advice on staying at Hippocrates Wellness.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#block_talkNow\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTalk now\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"467\" height=\"422\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/book-a-free-consultation.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Schedule a callback</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>If you would like to schedule a callback, or if it’s currently outside working hours, you can book a callback here. Choose the time you prefer and one of our wellness consultants will reach out to you then.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSchedule\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Useful contact information</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"tel:%20+1%20561%20623%201002\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"77\" height=\"76\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-04-15-180350.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"tel:%20+1%20561%20623%201002\">Bookings & reservations</a></h3><p>+1 561 623 1002</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Available 9 AM - 6 PM</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"tel:%20+1%20561%20471%208876\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"77\" height=\"76\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-04-15-180350.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"tel:%20+1%20561%20471%208876\">Front desk - General inquiries</a></h3><p>+1 561 471 8876</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Available 8 AM - 7 PM\n</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>HW Store / Mail Order <strong><a href=\"tel: 877-582-5850\">1-877-582-5850</a></strong> (USA) or <strong><a href=\"tel: 561-623-1019\">+1 561-623-1019</a></strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>HW Mail Order Hours<br>\nMonday – Friday: 9:00am – 4:30pm EST</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>HW Store Hours<br>\nMonday – Friday: 10:00am – 5:00pm<br>\nSaturday: 10:00am – 3:00pm<br>\nSunday: Closed</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Oasis Therapy Center<br /><a href=\"tel: 561-471-5867\">+1 561-471-5867</a></p><p>Salon<br /><strong><a href=\"tel: 866-515-9598\">+1 866-515-9598</a></strong></p><p>Vida<br /><strong><a href=\"tel: 561-471-8876\">+1 561-471-8876</a></strong> ext. 2161</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/bbb-accredited.jpg\" alt=\"bbb-accredited\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/best-of-raw.jpg\" alt=\"best-of-raw\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/chamber-of-commerce.jpg\" alt=\"chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hispanic-chamber-of-commerce.jpg\" alt=\"hispanic-chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ispa.jpg\" alt=\"ispa\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spas-of-america.jpg\" alt=\"spas-of-america\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/tripadivisor.jpg\" alt=\"tripadivisor\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vegan-of-the-year.jpg\" alt=\"vegan-of-the-year\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/wellness-travel-guide.jpg\" alt=\"wellness-travel-guide\" /></figure>", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": null, "terms": {}, "elementor": true}